  "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][eikra-vc-text-title style=\"style2\" title=\"Innovative Teaching Learning Methods\"][/eikra-vc-text-title][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_tta_accordion][vc_tta_section title=\"Flipped Classroom\" tab_id=\"1753785560725-afe5edf8-d09d\"][vc_column_text]\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The flipped classroom is an innovative pedagogical approach that transforms the traditional learning model. In a flipped classroom, students engage with instructional content, such as video lectures or readings, outside of class. This pre-class preparation frees up in-class time for interactive activities, discussions, and problem-solving. It fosters deeper understanding through real-time interactions with peers and instructors and prepares students for real-world application of knowledge. The contents are shared to the learners through Microsoft Teams.</p>\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-23779\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/flip-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">[/vc_column_text][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section title=\"Lab Videos\" tab_id=\"1753785560735-015f5efa-41b1\"][eikra-vc-text-title title=\"\"]\n<table class=\"center\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\" width=\"100%\" data-tablestyle=\"MsoTableGrid\" data-tablelook=\"1696\" aria-rowcount=\"22\">\n<tbody>\n<tr aria-rowindex=\"1\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\"><b>Gen AI-(BAIL657C)</b>&nbsp;</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr aria-rowindex=\"2\">\n<td data-celllook=\"4369\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Program 1</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:2,&quot;335551620&quot;:2,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td data-celllook=\"4369\">[embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GYlLsR0vQiM[/embed]\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GYlLsR0vQiM\"><s